{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07001","headline":"宿天竺寺 · 陶翰","name":"宿天竺寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"松柏乱岩口，山西微径通。\n天开一峯见，宫阙生虚空。\n正殿倚霞壁，千楼标石丛。\n夜来猨鸟静，钟梵响云中。\n岑翠映湖月，泉声乱溪风。\n心超诸境外，了与悬解同。\n明发唯改视，朝日长崖东。\n湖色浓荡漾，海光渐曈朦。\n葛仙迹尚在，许氏道犹崇。\n独往古来事，幽怀期二公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陶翰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07001.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07001","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}